{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>My terror.</b> As in 'their terror shall fall upon them' — terror and dread. All the people among whom you come, even if they are not of the seven nations. And its conclusion proves it: 'they shall not dwell in your land, lest they cause you to sin' — whereas for the seven nations it is written: 'you shall not leave alive any soul'."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:07.757530236Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}